Package: nmrdata
Type: Package
Title: Example 1d NMR Data for Metabolic Profiling
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Torben",
           family = "Kimhofer",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tkimhofer@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7158-9930"))
Description: Provides example one-dimensional proton NMR spectra of murine urine 
    samples collected before and after bariatric or sham surgery (Roux-en-Y gastric bypass). 
    The data are adapted from Jia V Li et al. (2011), "Metabolic surgery profoundly 
    influences gut microbial-host metabolic cross-talk", Gut, 60(9), 1214–1223. 
    <doi:10.1136/gut.2010.234708>. This package serves as example data for 
    metabolomics analysis and teaching purposes.
